{
  "Format": "PelipperTown/EvolutionStones/1",
  "_comment": [
    "Which species each evolution item advances, and what it becomes.",
    "",
    "An item is a SHORTCUT, not a requirement. Every species below keeps the",
    "level-based path authored in its own species data, so a player who never",
    "crafts a stone still reaches the same evolution by training. Using the right",
    "stone on your active companion evolves it immediately, ignoring level.",
    "",
    "Content packs may add their own file with the same Format to register more",
    "pairs, or override a pair by repeating its source species under the same",
    "item. Both the source and evolved species must be loaded; unknown IDs are",
    "reported and skipped at use time.",
    "",
    "Eevee is listed under five stones and keeps all eight authored branches,",
    "so items cover Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Leafeon, and Glaceon while the",
    "other routes still reach Sylveon, Espeon, and Umbreon."
  ],
